// A Context.Service class kept in a .vibe file declares what the Effect
// TypeScript in typescript/main.ts does, its key and Context.ServiceClass
// included, with Effect's types written through effect. EK4831 still offers
// the service declaration, whose key and declaration differ.
/** Dispatches messages to the view layer. */
export class Dispatch extends Context.Service<
  Dispatch,
  {
    readonly dispatchAsync: (message: unknown) => void!!
    readonly dispatchSync: (message: unknown) => void
  }
>()("@app/Dispatch") {}
